	(text "R23: nominal 299mA, charger tolerance +/-10%.\nTwo-wire protected battery. TEMP grounded: cell-temperature sensing disabled by user choice.\nBattery protection is not evidence of temperature protection. Verify cell ratings and assembled thermal behavior.\nUSB power budget / source-current handling remains an EVT release gate."
